      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعْلُوبٌ</span></b>  A <i>conspicuous</i> road (S, O, K, TA) <i>that
is marked in its two sides;</i> or <i>marked with the
traces of travellers.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And A sword
<i>broken in its edge.</i> (O.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُعَلَّبٌ</span>.

